      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0002",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0009",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "The toggle’s state is stored in `AppStorage` and used to determine whether or not to show the dialog when the “Delete Items” button is pressed.",
      "normalizedSource": "The toggle’s state is stored in `AppStorage` and used to determine whether or not to show the dialog when the “Delete Items” button is pressed.",
